      "introTitle": "About me",
      "introText": "My name is Vinícius and I'm a Backend Engineer based in Blumenau, Santa Catarina, Brazil. I specialize in C#/.NET, designing and implementing services from the API to the database with Entity Framework and Dapper, always trying to understand the problem and the business context before writing the first line of code. Over 4 years I've built and modernized business-critical systems: multi-tenant ERPs, biometric authentication with AWS Rekognition, real-time features with SignalR, and industrial platforms. I also have solid full-stack experience with React, TypeScript and Vue.js, which lets me work end to end when needed. I'm currently pursuing a bachelor's degree in Computer Science at FURB, and in 2026 I completed an academic exchange at Halmstad University, Sweden, studying Human-Centered AI, Big Data parallel programming and digital transformation.",
